      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Coming Up: Lesson 8</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">CAPSTONE — Living the Handbook</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"200\" width=\"900\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#0f0f1f\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\" rx=\"12\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"245\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#6366f1\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">The Synthesis Lesson</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">All 53 chapters. Every doctrine.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"325\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Applied to YOUR life.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"430\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#ec4899\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">In Lesson 8 We Will...</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"470\" width=\"430\" height=\"180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"315\" y=\"510\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Integrate</text><text x=\"315\" y=\"550\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">All seven lessons'</text><text x=\"315\" y=\"585\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">topoi</text><text x=\"315\" y=\"615\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A single coherent map</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"470\" width=\"430\" height=\"180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"785\" y=\"510\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Apply</text><text x=\"785\" y=\"550\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">To 6 modern cases:</text><text x=\"785\" y=\"585\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">elections, social media,</text><text x=\"785\" y=\"615\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">illness, betrayal, success, age</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"680\" width=\"430\" height=\"180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"315\" y=\"720\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Commit</text><text x=\"315\" y=\"760\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">To a 30-day</text><text x=\"315\" y=\"795\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">practice protocol</text><text x=\"315\" y=\"825\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Specific, signed, dated</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"680\" width=\"430\" height=\"180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"785\" y=\"720\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ec4899\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Take a final exam</text><text x=\"785\" y=\"760\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5+ quizzes across</text><text x=\"785\" y=\"795\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">all doctrines</text><text x=\"785\" y=\"825\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">From every previous lesson</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"950\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">The only question that finally matters: how will you live tomorrow?</text></svg>",
      "caption": "The capstone integrates everything and asks for action"
