      "svg": "<svg viewBox='0 0 1100 1100' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><rect x='0' y='0' width='1100' height='1100' fill='#1a1a2e'/><text x='550' y='90' font-size='30' fill='#ffd700' text-anchor='middle'>Quiz: The Agent Behind the List</text><rect x='150' y='180' width='800' height='180' rx='14' fill='#0ea5e9' opacity='0.2'/><text x='550' y='230' font-size='20' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>the up-to-us list</text><text x='550' y='280' font-size='18' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>judgments, desires, aversions, impulses</text><text x='550' y='320' font-size='16' fill='#888' text-anchor='middle'>items within our power</text><line x1='550' y1='380' x2='550' y2='450' stroke='#ffd700' stroke-width='5'/><text x='650' y='420' font-size='16' fill='#ffd700'>produced by</text><circle cx='550' cy='620' r='150' fill='#8b5cf6' opacity='0.6'/><text x='550' y='615' font-size='24' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>prohairesis</text><text x='550' y='650' font-size='17' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>the agent choosing</text><rect x='250' y='830' width='600' height='140' rx='14' fill='#f59e0b' opacity='0.2'/><text x='550' y='890' font-size='18' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>Which one is which?</text><text x='550' y='930' font-size='16' fill='#888' text-anchor='middle'>a list of items, versus the chooser itself</text></svg>",
